          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 13:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Baalaadár kilae múk doó Daudi nee yaamuloouusér Yerusalemu kin kutltá ma'aáy gweer ar tlakweema nee ar slasla/aremaá umuu adooro gi hamaatl.» ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.13.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 13:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AAKOÓ MUNGÚ aleesleemusmo i kaahi, «Baalaadár kilae aníng slaqsi'iidaá munguaá hatlá' in amór saáwí kwaáhh baraá yaamuwo, baraá inslawoó muko niri gunqaruutiyá', slám aaruusér lama an guús baraá yaamuwo nee qeeruú tlaakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.13.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 13:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Barnaxes heé wák ti adór aarusmo tlehhiit, baabuúwós nee aayoorós burngwa ariyé' ngun baya', ‹Kuúng a gaasa, asma lama ana axwés ar umuú AAKOÓ MUNGÚ.› Nee hamtidár kilá' iwa aaririn xwayliiteérós gun mút ar tsataay iri gwaa'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.13.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.13.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 13:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baalaadár kilae umuúqo aarusmoowo iigu'utuwós gun murér wa ar, tam hiyaydá' se'éngw koóm nguri mayá' dahamisuwo as muu mukuwa malé al/agín. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.13.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 13:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala umuú aarusmoowo in ooi, ‹Aníng a aarusmoowooká baloó ale, aníng a dooslusmo, yaamu ina aál iimír masoombi'iimar'eé' wa ale.› ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.13.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.13.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 13:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Barnaxes kwaa báy, ‹Xáy inkahhi'iisingaá gawaá dabaawók awa milá?› Inós iri ooi, ‹A inkahha'aá naa dír doó mulqumooeé' wa sláw.› »",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.13.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.13.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
